<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/arminius" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/arminius.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/september-9">9 September</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Germanic tribes destroy three Roman legions in the Teutoburg Forest</h3><p class="tih-event-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arminius">Arminius</a> led Germanic warriors in an ambush that wiped out three legions under Varus over several days, by tradition ending around this date. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> never again tried to conquer <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a> beyond the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rhine">Rhine</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/roman-empire">Roman Empire</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arminius">Arminius</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rhine">Rhine</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-teutoburg-forest" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-teutoburg-forest.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-teutoburg-forest">Battle of the Teutoburg Forest</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of the Teutoburg Forest was fought in 9 CE in Germania, where Germanic tribes led by Arminius ambushed and destroyed three Roman legions under Publius Quinctilius Varus.</p></div></li></ol></section>
